    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children in the area are disappearing one by one. No one knows\u2014or wants to know\u2014what is happening. But you will step into this cursed place to uncover the truth and find your missing brother. Now, you too must follow the same terrifying path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned area\u2026 Unbelievable experiments\u2026 A mad doctor who has imprisoned the souls of little girls\u2026 It is said that those who pass through there never return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/593f6280548eb0c7f6f382c1f95e74fe.poster.avif?t=1748531839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/593f6280548eb0c7f6f382c1f95e74fe.webm?t=1748531839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/593f6280548eb0c7f6f382c1f95e74fe.mp4?t=1748531839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resfer: Who Is There is a single-player horror game that will drag you into fear all by yourself. You will follow the traces of inhumane experiments carried out in a deserted area and try to uncover the tragic fate of the missing children. But be careful\u2026 You are not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and atmospheric sound design will draw you into fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story where psychological and supernatural horror intertwine will make you question every step you take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full of exploration and survival mechanics, dark rooms, mysterious clues and terrifying encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/0b343de2b364abb59dd330c9ed4cad74.poster.avif?t=1748531839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/0b343de2b364abb59dd330c9ed4cad74.webm?t=1748531839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597630/extras/0b343de2b364abb59dd330c9ed4cad74.mp4?t=1748531839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on this adventure to find him? But be careful\u2014sometimes the scariest thing is realizing you're not alone....\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>",
